responses with distance and stopping at clause punctuation. Reset at every
new document. Word fragments and capitals generally have weaker responses.

Apply the same pattern to common foreign infinitives, and recognize other
foreign forms of 'be', French contractions, a few modal/passive auxiliaries,
the 'toBe' equality matcher, and 'let me'. Chinese
passive '被' is positive. All unrecognized tokens predict zero. These are
textual approximations, not a full grammatical analysis.
