The component responds to the word "please" (any capitalisation, with or without a leading
space): its activation is about 7.6 on that token and close to 0 on nearly all other
tokens. It has weaker responses to a few words that open polite requests or suggestions,
graded roughly by strength. Everything else predicts 0; the small noise elsewhere is not
modelled.
